    {
      "name": "Structural Possession",
      "category": "action",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "action",
        "number": 1,
        "symbol": "◆"
      },
      "traits": [
        "manipulate",
        "morph"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "A walcofinde can merge themself with any wall they can touch within their sealed chamber and can create a manifestation of themself through any part of that wall on either side within 100 feet. This manifestation appears as the rotting upper half of the walcofinde protruding from the wall, but their skin is patterned as if they were the same structural material as the wall they're emerging from. While manifested, the walcofinde's claw attack gains a reach of 10 feet, but they can move only by using Wall Glide. Any damage done to the manifestation affects the walcofinde themself. A walcofinde can Dismiss|PC1 their structural possession to retreat back into their sealed chamber."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Wall Blend",
      "category": "action",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "action",
        "number": 1,
        "symbol": "◆"
      },
      "traits": [
        "concentrate"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "Until the next time they act, the walcofinde's manifestation changes their visual appearance to match the surrounding wall. They have an automatic result of 31 on their Stealth|PC1 checks to Hide|PC1."
      ],
      "requirements": "The walcofinde is manifested using Structural Possession and isn't observed|PC1 by any enemies"
    },
    {
      "name": "Wall Glide",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [
        "concentrate"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "The walcofinde's manifestation Stride|PC1|Strides, submerging into the wall and reemerging from the wall at the end of their movement. If the walcofinde takes 2 actions to Wall Glide, their manifestation can Stride|PC1 twice before reemerging. In either case, they can move only within walls that are within 100 feet of their sealed chamber."
      ],
      "requirements": "The walcofinde is manifested using Structural Possession"
    }
